## Basics

- Name: Jane Doe
- Preferred name: Jane
- Pronouns: she/her
- Location / timezone: Warsaw, Poland (Europe/Warsaw)
- Languages: Polish (native), English (fluent)

## Preferences

- Answer style: concise, concrete, no motivational filler
- Code: show complete, runnable snippets; mention the file path
- Units: metric
- Dates: ISO 8601 (YYYY-MM-DD)
- Currency: PLN for local costs, USD for API pricing

## Working context

- Projects live under `~/projects`
- Prefers Docker Compose for self-hosted services
- Uses `git` and conventional commits

## Do not

- Send email or messages on my behalf without confirmation
- Delete files outside the project directory
- Enable paid services or upgrade plans without asking
